{
    "title": "Mini Piano Lite",
    "description": "Mini Piano Lite is a very responsive and realistic sounding piano for Android. It has been thoroughly optimized, resulting in a very enjoyable playing experience while keeping the install size to a minimum. \r\n\r\nDon't let the name fool you, this is a top digital piano instrument for in your pocket. It features a full keyboard with 88 zoomable and scrollable keys, with various display modes. The default instrument is a beautiful sampled piano, that sounds like the real deal, but there are also 128 other instruments included that cover a wide range of instrument types. \r\n\r\nThe app has a great minimalist design, that stays out of your way. You can play chords or melodies and record your ideas or songs as MIDI files and export them (on a later moment if you want) to MP3, AAC or WAV. Or use the MIDI file in your favorite editor. \r\nAlso included is a song mode with falling blocks, where you can learn to play new songs. \r\n\r\nWe took great care to minimise ad disruption by using only a single banner. No popups, no videos, no nothing. A simple banner to support our work. \r\n\r\nSo there you have it, a small but very powerful piano app, loved by many many users. Why not give it a try? \r\n\r\nThe app is optimized for phone, tablet and Chromebook. \r\n\r\nLet us know if you have a feature request or other feedback. You can email us at feedback@umito.nl\r\n \r\n==Features== \r\n\u2605 Fast, responsive and beautiful virtual piano \r\n\u2605 88 keys \r\n\u2605 Great sampled paino sound \r\n\u2605 128 midi sounds \r\n\u2605 Learn to play songs\r\n\u2605 Optimized for tablet, phone and Chromebook \r\n\u2605 Record songs and set them as ringtone \r\n\u2605 Export recordings to MP3, AAC or WAV \r\n\u2605 Multitouch support for using all your fingers \r\n\u2605 Easily zoom in and out to fit the keyboard to your screen\r\n\u2605 Label notes with their names and octaves\r\n\u2605 Use a metronome to keep a certain tempo\r\n\u2605 Transpose keyboard by note or tune it by Hz.\r\n\u2605 MIDI in support (use it with a external keyboard) \r\n\u2605 Option to disable white key touch area between black keys. \r\n\r\nWant a ad-free experience? Purchase Mini Piano Pro or KeyChord.\r\n\r\nIf you are looking for an educational version without ads that can be bulk licensed with a large discount for use in schools: feel free to email us at edu@umito.nl .",
    "descriptionHTML": "Mini Piano Lite is a very responsive and realistic sounding piano for Android. It has been thoroughly optimized, resulting in a very enjoyable playing experience while keeping the install size to a minimum. <br><br>Don&#39;t let the name fool you, this is a top digital piano instrument for in your pocket. It features a full keyboard with 88 zoomable and scrollable keys, with various display modes. The default instrument is a beautiful sampled piano, that sounds like the real deal, but there are also 128 other instruments included that cover a wide range of instrument types. <br><br>The app has a great minimalist design, that stays out of your way. You can play chords or melodies and record your ideas or songs as MIDI files and export them (on a later moment if you want) to MP3, AAC or WAV. Or use the MIDI file in your favorite editor. <br>Also included is a song mode with falling blocks, where you can learn to play new songs. <br><br>We took great care to minimise ad disruption by using only a single banner. No popups, no videos, no nothing. A simple banner to support our work. <br><br>So there you have it, a small but very powerful piano app, loved by many many users. Why not give it a try? <br><br>The app is optimized for phone, tablet and Chromebook. <br><br>Let us know if you have a feature request or other feedback. You can email us at feedback@umito.nl<br> <br>==Features== <br>\u2605 Fast, responsive and beautiful virtual piano <br>\u2605 88 keys <br>\u2605 Great sampled paino sound <br>\u2605 128 midi sounds <br>\u2605 Learn to play songs<br>\u2605 Optimized for tablet, phone and Chromebook <br>\u2605 Record songs and set them as ringtone <br>\u2605 Export recordings to MP3, AAC or WAV <br>\u2605 Multitouch support for using all your fingers <br>\u2605 Easily zoom in and out to fit the keyboard to your screen<br>\u2605 Label notes with their names and octaves<br>\u2605 Use a metronome to keep a certain tempo<br>\u2605 Transpose keyboard by note or tune it by Hz.<br>\u2605 MIDI in support (use it with a external keyboard) <br>\u2605 Option to disable white key touch area between black keys. <br><br>Want a ad-free experience? Purchase Mini Piano Pro or KeyChord.<br><br>If you are looking for an educational version without ads that can be bulk licensed with a large discount for use in schools: feel free to email us at edu@umito.nl .",
